          "text": "Description: A witness observed on January 15, 2009 at 10:15 AM, the slow northeast to southeast movement of a white, lenticular-shaped phenomenon. One of the hypotheses considered was that of a lenticular cloud. However, no investigation could be conducted due to the lack of information provided by the witness, despite the request from GEIPAN. This case is classified \"C\" due to lack of information.",
